// Cyrus -> Nxeon webhooks end to end without a network: Cyrus' event builders + outbox + dispatcher
// (lib/cyrus/api/v1/webhooks.ts) deliver into Nxeon's receiver (lib/cyrus-client/webhook-receiver.ts) through a fake
// fetch. Signatures, freshness, exactly-once, secret rotation, the retry schedule, dead letters, the fail-closed config.
